 ## Background
-Semantic loss was introduced in the context of Neural Radiance Fields (NeRF) to extend 3D reconstruction to semantic understanding [S1, S2]. The concept of using cross-entropy for semantic labeling in NeRF appears in [S1] (Semantic Ray, CVPR 2023) and [S2] (NeRF-LiDAR, AAAI 2024) [S1, S2]. The weak label variant specifically addresses the lack of labeled driving data by leveraging large-scale 2D segmentation models [S2].
